{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And they shall serve him.</b> For upon him is laid the charge of everything, as it says (Numbers 18:1): אַתָּה וּבָנֶיךָ וּבֵית אָבִיךָ אִתָּךְ תִּשְׂאוּ אֶת עֲוֺן הַמִּקְדָּשׁ, וְאַתָּה וּבָנֶיךָ אִתָּךְ תִּשְׂאוּ אֶת עֲוֺן כְּהֻנַּתְכֶם. And so the service of the Levites was a service to the High Priest in the portion laid upon him — the guarding of the Mishkan and its vessels, and the guarding of the priesthood, that no unauthorized person draw near, which is laid upon Aaron and his sons alone."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:39.442808792Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}